7. The points that arise for my consideration are;
1. Whether the prosecution proves beyond all reasonable doubt that, on 06.03.2020 accused No.1 and 2 being an owner and manager respectively of Udupi Vaibhava Hotel, near Marathahalli Bridge,
HAL have appointed the deceased Ganesh as server in the said hotel and on 15.03.2020 at about 8.45 PM, the said deceased Ganesh went in a temporary lift from ground floor to first floor in the said hotel to serve the food, by that time, he was struck in the said temporary lift and succumbed to death due to the negligent act of accused No.1 and 2 in not making proper and safety requirements towards the said lift and thereby committed an offence punishable U/s.304A of IPC ?
